{"type":"message","id":"a0f973b1","parentId":"10dda5d3","timestamp":"2026-06-09T00:53:20.821Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can see more. Let me look at the actual scoring and trade events more carefully:\n\n1. 08:27:33 - DOT triggered AI: open signal confirmed (100 points)\n2. 08:27:42 - DOT short opened @0.961 | Score: 100 | Market: trending | AI: long (65%) | Order success\n3. After that, LINK was skipped at 08:27:42 (max positions reached)\n4. At 08:40:41, BTC is at max positions and some discrepancies appear (API positions=4, local cache=3)\n\nThe DOT signal was 100 points but the AI said \"做多(65%)\" while the system opened a SHORT. That's a disagreement - the AI predicted long but the mathematical score went short. Let me look at that more carefully.\n\nAlso there were two monitor restarts - at 08:51:32 and 08:52:28. That's concerning.\n\nBut the user's question is specifically \"分数统计出问题了吗\" - is the scoring broken?\n\nLooking at the data:\n- DOT: 100 score, trending market, AI disagreed (long 65%) but system went short → this is a legitimate case where math overrules AI per the strategy rules\n- The DOT short is actually profitable (+1.90 USDT), so the math was right and AI was wrong\n- LINK had 17 stop-loss sells - this was a cascading stop-loss event\n- BTC and XRP longs are underwater\n\nThe scoring itself appears to be working:\n- Audit says 49 scans, scoring is normal\n- DOT signal scored 100 and went short, which is currently profitable\n- The system is properly throttling at 4 max positions\n\nThe real issue isn't scoring - it's that:\n1. The market has been bearish today (BTC down, long positions losing)\n2. LINK got stopped out hard with cascade losses\n3. The system hit its position limit and can't hedge/adjust\n\nAlso worth noting: the fear & greed index shows 10 (extreme fear) - the market is very bearish.\n\nLet me also check those monitor restarts - are they normal or is the monitor crashing?","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"评分系统本身没坏，策略审计也确认了。不过让我看看 LINK 当时的开仓信号和最近的几次重启。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_6GmEFHI4vKyTzAedTODv6927","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -n 'LINK.*评分\\|LINK.*开\\|LINK.*AI\\|LINK.*stop\\|LINK.*止损' /root/.openclaw/logs/trading/monitor.log 2>/dev/null | tail -20","timeout":10}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_GqBsmZOKcRJRPc2t76ez8343","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -c 'crypto_signal_monitor v6.0 启动' /root/.openclaw/logs/trading/monitor.log 2>/dev/null; echo \"---\"; grep 'crypto_signal_monitor v6.0 启动' /root/.openclaw/logs/trading/monitor.log 2>/dev/null | tail -10","timeout":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1680,"output":1180,"cacheRead":31232,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":34092,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780966389873}}
