{"type":"message","id":"42f99814","parentId":"d9f6594f","timestamp":"2026-06-09T12:05:36.090Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me look at the actual scoring function more carefully. Let me see the main signal computation.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_rgocyt6TBc95eyzQzkiO0755","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && sed -n '510,580p' crypto_signal_monitor.py","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1073,"output":124,"cacheRead":33280,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":34477,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1781006733727}}
{"type":"message","id":"2ac9b724","parentId":"42f99814","timestamp":"2026-06-09T12:05:36.345Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_rgocyt6TBc95eyzQzkiO0755","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":") -> tuple[int, str]:\n    \"\"\"\n    返回 (score, direction)\n    direction: 'LONG' | 'SHORT' | 'NONE'\n    \"\"\"\n    if not ind or not price_data:\n        return 0, \"NONE\"\n\n    price      = float(price_data.get(\"price\") or ind.get(\"last_close\") or 0)\n    # 成交量：优先 15m K 线 vol_current（与 vol_avg20 同量纲），避免 WS 24h 量纲不一致\n    vol        = float(ind.get(\"vol_current\") or price_data.get(\"volume\") or 0)\n    vol_avg    = ind[\"vol_avg20\"]\n    atr_pct    = ind[\"atr_pct\"]\n    resistance = ind[\"resistance\"]\n    support    = ind[\"support\"]\n\n    long_score  = 0\n    short_score = 0\n\n    # ① 价格突破（40 分）\n    if price >= resistance * 0.999:\n        long_score += 40\n    if price <= support * 1.001:\n        short_score += 40\n\n    # ② 成交量放大确认（30 分）\n    if vol > vol_avg * 1.5:\n        long_score  += 30\n        short_score += 30\n    elif vol > vol_avg * 1.2:\n        long_score  += 15\n        short_score += 15\n\n    # ③ ATR 波动率适中（20 分）\n    if 0.005 < atr_pct < 0.03:\n        long_score  += 20\n        short_score += 20\n\n    # ④ BTC 大盘方向（10 分）- 2026-03-28 老公指示：用 BTC 代替 ETH\n    _btc = btc_ind if btc_ind else {}\n    if _btc:\n        btc_bull = _btc.get(\"ema20_15m\", 0) > _btc.get(\"ema60_15m\", 0)\n        if btc_bull:\n            long_score  += 10\n            short_score -= 5\n        else:\n            short_score += 10\n            long_score  -= 5\n\n    long_score  = max(0, long_score)\n    short_score = max(0, short_score)\n\n    threshold = CONFIG[\"score_threshold\"][regime]\n    # 单币阈值加成：低胜率币种提高门槛\n    threshold += CONFIG[\"score_threshold\"].get(\"per_symbol_bonus\", {}).get(symbol, 0)\n    if long_score > short_score and long_score >= threshold:\n        return long_score, \"LONG\"\n    elif short_score > long_score and short_score >= threshold:\n        return short_score, \"SHORT\"\n\n    return max(long_score, short_score), \"NONE\"\n\n\ndef calc_tp_sl(\n    entry: float,\n    direction: str,\n    ind: dict,\n    price_data: dict,\n) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"\n    返回 {tp1, sl}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":126,"aggregated":") -> tuple[int, str]:\n    \"\"\"\n    返回 (score, direction)\n    direction: 'LONG' | 'SHORT' | 'NONE'\n    \"\"\"\n    if not ind or not price_data:\n        return 0, \"NONE\"\n\n    price      = float(price_data.get(\"price\") or ind.get(\"last_close\") or 0)\n    # 成交量：优先 15m K 线 vol_current（与 vol_avg20 同量纲），避免 WS 24h 量纲不一致\n    vol        = float(ind.get(\"vol_current\") or price_data.get(\"volume\") or 0)\n    vol_avg    = ind[\"vol_avg20\"]\n    atr_pct    = ind[\"atr_pct\"]\n    resistance = ind[\"resistance\"]\n    support    = ind[\"support\"]\n\n    long_score  = 0\n    short_score = 0\n\n    # ① 价格突破（40 分）\n    if price >= resistance * 0.999:\n        long_score += 40\n    if price <= support * 1.001:\n        short_score += 40\n\n    # ② 成交量放大确认（30 分）\n    if vol > vol_avg * 1.5:\n        long_score  += 30\n        short_score += 30\n    elif vol > vol_avg * 1.2:\n        long_score  += 15\n        short_score += 15\n\n    # ③ ATR 波动率适中（20 分）\n    if 0.005 < atr_pct < 0.03:\n        long_score  += 20\n        short_score += 20\n\n    # ④ BTC 大盘方向（10 分）- 2026-03-28 老公指示：用 BTC 代替 ETH\n    _btc = btc_ind if btc_ind else {}\n    if _btc:\n        btc_bull = _btc.get(\"ema20_15m\", 0) > _btc.get(\"ema60_15m\", 0)\n        if btc_bull:\n            long_score  += 10\n            short_score -= 5\n        else:\n            short_score += 10\n            long_score  -= 5\n\n    long_score  = max(0, long_score)\n    short_score = max(0, short_score)\n\n    threshold = CONFIG[\"score_threshold\"][regime]\n    # 单币阈值加成：低胜率币种提高门槛\n    threshold += CONFIG[\"score_threshold\"].get(\"per_symbol_bonus\", {}).get(symbol, 0)\n    if long_score > short_score and long_score >= threshold:\n        return long_score, \"LONG\"\n    elif short_score > long_score and short_score >= threshold:\n        return short_score, \"SHORT\"\n\n    return max(long_score, short_score), \"NONE\"\n\n\ndef calc_tp_sl(\n    entry: float,\n    direction: str,\n    ind: dict,\n    price_data: dict,\n) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"\n    返回 {tp1, sl}","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1781006736314}}
{"type":"message","id":"467e5025","parentId":"2ac9b724","timestamp":"2026-06-09T12:06:03.008Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting! Let me analyze the scoring:\n\nThe scoring is:\n1. **Price Breakout (40 pts)**: Long if price >= resistance*0.999, Short if price <= support*1.001\n2. **Volume Confirmation (30 pts)**: Both get points if volume > average\n3. **ATR Volatility (20 pts)**: Both get same points if ATR is moderate (0.5%-3%)\n4. **BTC Trend (10 pts)**: Long if BTC bullish (EMA20 > EMA60), Short if bearish\n\nNow the key question is: does this score have a systematic long bias?\n\nLooking at it:\n- Items ② and ③ are neutral - both long and short get equal points\n- Item ① (40 pts) is directional based on resistance/support - in a downtrend, price keeps breaking below support, which gives short signals (good). In an uptrend, price breaks above resistance, giving long signals (good). This makes sense.\n- Item ④ (10 pts) follows BTC trend - in bearish market, this gives +10 short and -5 long\n\nThe problem is: this is a **breakout/momentum** system. It generates a LONG signal when price is going UP and breaking resistance, and a SHORT signal when price is going DOWN and breaking support.\n\nBut looking at the current situation: Fear & Greed = 10 (extreme fear), market is bearish. If the market keeps dropping, the system should be generating SHORT signals as price breaks below support levels.\n\nWait, but the positions show:\n- BTC LONG (opened at $63251.10) - losing\n- XRP LONG (opened at $1.17) - losing  \n- DOT SHORT (opened at $0.96) - winning\n- LINK was LONG (stopped out at ~$7.82) - was a loss\n\nSo 3 longs, 1 short. The longs were opened when the market was going up (breaking resistance), then the market reversed and they got caught.\n\nThe issue isn't a scoring bias per se—it's that this is a momentum-following system that naturally goes long in upswings and short in downswings. In a choppy or reversing market, it gets whipsawed.\n\nBut wait, the user said \"一直找不对方向\" - the system keeps picking wrong direction. Let me check the SOL cooling specifically since AGENTS.md mentions \"SOL 高频低胜率，拉长冷却\".\n\nActually, the real problem might be more subtle. Let me look at the sentiment function:\n\n```python\nif direction == \"LONG\":\n    if fg < 25:       bonus += 10   # 极度恐惧做多\n```\n\nFear & Greed = 10 (extreme fear), so long gets +10 bonus. But the market keeps dropping! So the system sees extreme fear → adds bonus to long → opens long → market drops more → long loses money. This IS a bias - it's a contrarian bias that's failing in this market.\n\nAlso the funding rate check: if fr < -0.001, adds +5 to long (short positions paying longs). In a sustained bear market, funding rates can stay negative for a long time.\n\nSo the system has a built-in **contrarian bias** that adds up to +15 to long scores in extreme fear markets. Combined with the breakout scoring, when there's a temporary bounce in a bear market, the system sees: breakout (+40) + volume (+15) + sentiment (+15) = already at 70. That's above the ranging threshold of 30, and maybe even above the trending threshold if the EMA is sloping.\n\nThe solution would be to either:\n1. Reduce the sentiment bonus weight\n2. Add a trend filter (e.g., only take longs when the overall trend is up)\n3. Add a market regime filter that's more aggressive about going with the trend\n\nLet me also check what market regime was active for these trades.\n\nActually, I should give the user a concise answer about what I found rather than diving deeper. The key insight is: the system has a contrarian sentiment bias that fights the trend in bear markets.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"找到根子了。评分公式里有个结构性偏向：\n\n**情绪加分在做反向押注**\n恐惧贪婪指数现在才 10（极度恐惧），系统会偷偷给多头加 10 分——逻辑是「别人恐慌我贪婪」。但问题是市场持续下跌，这个逆向加分反而让系统不断去接飞刀。\n\n具体看评分构成：\n- 价格突破阻力/支撑 → 方向性 40 分 ✅ 没问题\n- 成交量放大 → 两边都加 ✅ 没问题  \n- ATR 适中 → 两边都加 ✅ 没问题\n- **情绪加分 → 极度恐惧强行加多 +10 分 ⚠️ 在持续下跌市里是毒药**\n- BTC 大盘方向 → 空头 +10 多头 -5 ✅ 这个反而在帮空头\n\n等于说信号层拼命拉多头，大盘方向层拼命拉空头，两边在打架。现在空头赢（恐惧 10 + BTC 下行），但情绪加分还在偷偷给多头输血，导致不该开的多头也被推过了阈值。\n\n要修吗？方案很直接：**在极端恐惧（<25）时把情绪加分从「做多+10」改成「做空不扣分」**，让它不再和趋势对着干。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":695,"output":2022,"cacheRead":34432,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":37149,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1781006736354}}
