{"type":"message","id":"d3c8ee25","parentId":"e157b97c","timestamp":"2026-06-09T12:06:05.840Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"找到根子了。评分公式里有个结构性偏向：\n\n**情绪加分在做反向押注**\n恐惧贪婪指数现在才 10（极度恐惧），系统会偷偷给多头加 10 分——逻辑是「别人恐慌我贪婪」。但问题是市场持续下跌，这个逆向加分反而让系统不断去接飞刀。\n\n具体看评分构成：\n- 价格突破阻力/支撑 → 方向性 40 分 ✅ 没问题\n- 成交量放大 → 两边都加 ✅ 没问题  \n- ATR 适中 → 两边都加 ✅ 没问题\n- **情绪加分 → 极度恐惧强行加多 +10 分 ⚠️ 在持续下跌市里是毒药**\n- BTC 大盘方向 → 空头 +10 多头 -5 ✅ 这个反而在帮空头\n\n等于说信号层拼命拉多头，大盘方向层拼命拉空头，两边在打架。现在空头赢（恐惧 10 + BTC 下行），但情绪加分还在偷偷给多头输血，导致不该开的多头也被推过了阈值。\n\n要修吗？方案很直接：**在极端恐惧（<25）时把情绪加分从「做多+10」改成「做空不扣分」**，让它不再和趋势对着干。"}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"openclaw","model":"delivery-mirror","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1781006765840}}
{"type":"message","id":"99e219b2","parentId":"d3c8ee25","timestamp":"2026-06-09T12:10:33.446Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6db4655cc0a4b1cbd6d411a47a2\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户124241\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-06-09 20:10 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户124241 (ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"name\": \"用户124241\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6db4655cc0a4b1cbd6d411a47a2]\n用户124241: 好，改完检查逻辑代码"}],"timestamp":1781007033424}}
{"type":"message","id":"2daf6559","parentId":"99e219b2","timestamp":"2026-06-09T12:10:45.179Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user said \"好，改完检查逻辑代码\" - meaning they want me to make the change and then check the logic code. Let me:\n\n1. Modify the sentiment_score function in crypto_signal_monitor.py\n2. After modifying, verify the change looks correct\n\nThe change: In extreme fear (<25), change the sentiment bonus from \"+10 to LONG\" to something that doesn't fight the trend. Let me think about what's best:\n\nCurrent code:\n```python\nif direction == \"LONG\":\n    if fg < 25:       bonus += 10   # 极度恐惧做多\n    elif fg < 40:     bonus += 5\n```\n\nProposed change: In extreme fear, reduce/remove the long bonus. Options:\na) Remove entirely: no bonus for LONG when fg < 25\nb) Only give the bonus when BTC trend is also bullish (already handled by BTC trend scoring)\nc) Keep the bonus but reduce it\n\nI think option (a) is cleanest: remove the fg < 25 bonus for LONG entirely. The \"别人恐慌我贪婪\" logic works in some markets but in sustained downtrends it's harmful.\n\nActually, let me think again. The user said \"在极端恐惧（<25）时把情绪加分从「做多+10」改成「做空不扣分」\". This means: instead of giving +10 to LONG, just don't penalize SHORT. But wait, the current code doesn't penalize short for fg < 25 - it only adds bonus to long.\n\nActually, looking at the current code more carefully:\n\n```python\nif direction == \"LONG\":\n    if fg < 25:       bonus += 10\n    elif fg < 40:     bonus += 5\n    if fr < -0.001:   bonus += 5\nelif direction == \"SHORT\":\n    if fg > 75:       bonus += 10\n    elif fg > 60:     bonus += 5\n    if fr > 0.002:    bonus += 5\n```\n\nThe simplest fix: remove or reduce the fg < 25 bonus for LONG. Let me just remove that line entirely, so extreme fear gives 0 bonus instead of +10. And for fg < 40, maybe reduce from +5 to 0 or +3.\n\nLet me make the change.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_HFd4Nn9XU2RCf1WmGosY9047","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","offset":482,"limit":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":617,"output":1106,"cacheRead":36224,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":37947,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1781007033441}}
{"type":"message","id":"38022e72","parentId":"2daf6559","timestamp":"2026-06-09T12:10:45.276Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_HFd4Nn9XU2RCf1WmGosY9047","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"        self._fr_ts = time.time()\n        return rates\n\n    def sentiment_score(self, symbol: str, direction: str, fg: int, fr: float) -> int:\n        \"\"\"情绪加分，最多+15分\"\"\"\n        bonus = 0\n        if direction == \"LONG\":\n            if fg < 25:       bonus += 10   # 极度恐惧做多\n            elif fg < 40:     bonus += 5\n            if fr < -0.001:   bonus += 5    # 空头付费，多头有利\n        elif direction == \"SHORT\":\n            if fg > 75:       bonus += 10   # 极度贪婪做空\n            elif fg > 60:     bonus += 5\n            if fr > 0.002:    bonus += 5    # 多头付费过高，反转信号\n        return bonus\n\n\n# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n# 五、信号评分系统 v6.0\n# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\ndef calc_score(\n    symbol: str,\n    price_data: dict,\n    ind: dict,\n    regime: str,\n    fg: int,\n    funding_rate: float,\n    btc_ind: dict,  # 2026-03-28 老公指示：用 BTC 作为大盘参考\n) -> tuple[int, str]:\n    \"\"\"\n\n[2278 more lines in file. Use offset=512 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1781007045268}}
