{"type":"message","id":"ad413b7b","parentId":"f584fd2c","timestamp":"2026-06-09T12:17:37.648Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The SOUL.md has scoring dimensions described. Let me look at the full scoring section and the sentiment section there. Also need to check if the scoring description in SOUL.md needs to match the actual code.\n\nLet me also check SOUL.md for the current scoring description more fully.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_tgigD0kGnXK8LsMHGBXI0823","name":"read","arguments":{"offset":50,"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/SOUL.md","limit":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":205,"output":201,"cacheRead":44160,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":44566,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1781007454403}}
{"type":"message","id":"992c2f84","parentId":"ad413b7b","timestamp":"2026-06-09T12:17:37.736Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_tgigD0kGnXK8LsMHGBXI0823","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"### 监控职责\n\n1. **价格监控** - 15 秒检查 7 币种 (BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, DOT, LINK, XRP)\n2. **信号生成** - RSI + MA60 + 24h 涨跌 + 成交量，评分 0-100\n3. **新闻分析** - CoinDesk RSS，中文翻译\n4. **持仓追踪** - 智能推算止盈止损\n5. **及时通知** - 有信号立刻推送，每小时汇报\n\n### 动态开仓阈值\n\n| 市场状态 | 判定 | 阈值 | 仓位 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Trending | EMA 斜率>0.5% | ≥70 | 25% |\n| Ranging | 默认 | ≥30 | 25% |\n| Volatile | ATR>5% | ≥90 | 15% |\n\n**评分维度 (0-100)：**\n- RSI (35分) - <35 做多 +35, >65 做空 +35\n- 24h涨跌 (25分) - 跌>5% 做多 +25, 涨>5% 做空 +25\n- MA60 (20分) - 价格≥MA60 做多 +20, ≤MA60 做空 +20\n- 成交量 (20分) - >20周期平均 +20\n\n### 三档移动止盈（全部平仓）\n\n| 档位 | 利润 | 锁定 | 说明 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| 第1档 | +2% | 0.8% | 保底 |\n| 第2档 | +3% | 2% | ⭐️ 老公指示 |\n| 第3档 | +4% | 全部平仓 | 落袋为安 |\n\n\n[75 more lines in file. Use offset=80 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1781007457719}}
{"type":"message","id":"f79e7d9d","parentId":"992c2f84","timestamp":"2026-06-09T12:17:48.671Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I see - the scoring described in SOUL.md is the OLD scoring system (RSI + MA60 + 24h change + volume). But the actual code uses a different scoring system (price breakout + volume + ATR + BTC trend + sentiment). The SOUL.md is out of date.\n\nLet me now make all the changes:\n\n1. **crypto_signal_monitor.py**: \n   - Reverse sentiment_score logic (fear → SHORT, greed → LONG)\n   - Wire sentiment_score into calc_score\n\n2. **SOUL.md**: Update scoring dimensions to match actual code\n\n3. **AGENTS.md**: Update if there's relevant info\n\nLet me do this step by step. First, the code changes.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"SOUL.md 里的评分描述是旧的（RSI+MA60），实际代码早就不一样了——也得一起更新。开始改："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_d3J0gH0T35vO0bRWhnfS1712","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","old_string":"    def sentiment_score(self, symbol: str, direction: str, fg: int, fr: float) -> int:\n        \"\"\"情绪加分，最多+15分\"\"\"\n        bonus = 0\n        if direction == \"LONG\":\n            # 2026-06-09 老公指示：极度恐惧不再加分，避免在下跌市里接飞刀\n            if fg < 40:       bonus += 5\n            if fr < -0.001:   bonus += 5    # 空头付费，多头有利\n        elif direction == \"SHORT\":\n            if fg > 75:       bonus += 10   # 极度贪婪做空\n            elif fg > 60:     bonus += 5\n            if fr > 0.002:    bonus += 5    # 多头付费过高，反转信号\n        return bonus","new_string":"    def sentiment_score(self, symbol: str, direction: str, fg: int, fr: float) -> int:\n        \"\"\"情绪加分，最多+15分\n        \n        2026-06-09 老公指示：趋势跟随代替反向押注\n        - 恐惧 → 做空（顺势），贪婪 → 做多（顺势）\n        - 资金费率极端 → 反向（拥挤交易反转）\n        \"\"\"\n        bonus = 0\n        if direction == \"LONG\":\n            if fg > 75:       bonus += 10   # 极度贪婪做多（顺势）\n            elif fg > 60:     bonus += 5\n            if fr > 0.002:    bonus += 5    # 多头付费过高，做多拥挤 → 反转做空，此处不适用\n        elif direction == \"SHORT\":\n            if fg < 25:       bonus += 10   # 极度恐惧做空（顺势，不接飞刀）\n            elif fg < 40:     bonus += 5\n            if fr < -0.001:   bonus += 5    # 空头付费过高，做空拥挤 → 反转做多，此处不适用\n        return bonus"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":527,"output":873,"cacheRead":44416,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45816,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1781007457750}}
