{"type":"message","id":"8b299c0b","parentId":"26e58489","timestamp":"2026-06-09T12:20:18.935Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_KyC8Ft7zJEJSFsV6W3b86601","toolName":"edit","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully replaced text in /root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py."}],"details":{"diff":"      ...\n  495         bonus = 0\n  496         if direction == \"LONG\":\n  497             if fg > 75:       bonus += 10   # 极度贪婪做多（顺势）\n  498             elif fg > 60:     bonus += 5\n- 499             if fr > 0.002:    bonus += 5    # 多头付费过高，做多拥挤 → 反转做空，此处不适用\n+ 499             if fr > 0.002:    bonus += 5    # 多头付费（多头主导）→ 做多顺势\n  500         elif direction == \"SHORT\":\n  501             if fg < 25:       bonus += 10   # 极度恐惧做空（顺势，不接飞刀）\n  502             elif fg < 40:     bonus += 5\n- 503             if fr < -0.001:   bonus += 5    # 空头付费过高，做空拥挤 → 反转做多，此处不适用\n+ 503             if fr < -0.001:   bonus += 5    # 空头付费（空头主导）→ 做空顺势\n  504         return bonus\n  505 \n  506 \n  507 # ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n      ...","firstChangedLine":499},"isError":false,"timestamp":1781007618924}}
{"type":"message","id":"0ec1c13d","parentId":"8b299c0b","timestamp":"2026-06-09T12:20:34.795Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. Now let me do a final syntax check and then give the summary.\n\nLet me also check if there's a comment at the top of the file that should be updated, or any other doc sections.\n\nAlso - the user said \"改完检查逻辑代码\" - let me do a thorough check of the logic once more before reporting.\n\nLet me trace through a concrete scenario:\n- fg = 10 (extreme fear), fr = -0.003 (shorts paying longs - very negative)\n- Direction = SHORT: fg < 25 → +10, fr < -0.001 → +5, total = +15\n- Direction = LONG: fg not > 75, fr not > 0.002 → total = 0\n\nSo in extreme fear with negative funding, SHORT gets +15, LONG gets 0. This means any SHORT signal that was borderline (5-15 points below threshold) will now trigger. And LONG signals lose their previous sentiment boost. \n\nThis should dramatically reduce the \"接飞刀\" problem.\n\nLet me also check the reverse: fg = 80 (extreme greed), fr = 0.005\n- Direction = LONG: fg > 75 → +10, fr > 0.002 → +5, total = +15\n- Direction = SHORT: fg not < 25, fr not < -0.001 → total = 0\n\nGood, fully symmetric.\n\nNow let me also think about the impact on existing positions. The current positions won't be affected directly - the sentiment change only affects new signal generation. But with the next monitor restart, the sentiment engine will be active and new signals will be filtered differently.\n\nLet me finalize and give a summary.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"最后验证一遍完整逻辑："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_UREq0S0Ox6sH4mRzJj1c1738","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport ast\nwith open('crypto_signal_monitor.py') as f:\n    ast.parse(f.read())\nprint('✅ 语法检查通过')\n\n# 逻辑验证：极端恐惧场景\n# fg=10, fr=-0.003\nlong_bonus = 0\nshort_bonus = 0\n# LONG:\nfg = 10\nif fg > 75: long_bonus += 10\nelif fg > 60: long_bonus += 5\nfr = -0.003\nif fr > 0.002: long_bonus += 5\n# SHORT:\nif fg < 25: short_bonus += 10\nelif fg < 40: short_bonus += 5\nif fr < -0.001: short_bonus += 5\n\nprint(f'极端恐惧(fg=10, fr=-0.003): LONG+{long_bonus}, SHORT+{short_bonus}')\n\n# 极度贪婪场景\nfg = 80\nfr = 0.005\nlong_bonus = 0\nshort_bonus = 0\nif fg > 75: long_bonus += 10\nelif fg > 60: long_bonus += 5\nif fr > 0.002: long_bonus += 5\nif fg < 25: short_bonus += 10\nelif fg < 40: short_bonus += 5\nif fr < -0.001: short_bonus += 5\nprint(f'极度贪婪(fg=80, fr=0.005): LONG+{long_bonus}, SHORT+{short_bonus}')\n\n# 震荡中性\nfg = 50\nfr = 0.0001\nlong_bonus = 0\nshort_bonus = 0\nif fg > 75: long_bonus += 10\nelif fg > 60: long_bonus += 5\nif fr > 0.002: long_bonus += 5\nif fg < 25: short_bonus += 10\nelif fg < 40: short_bonus += 5\nif fr < -0.001: short_bonus += 5\nprint(f'震荡中性(fg=50, fr~0): LONG+{long_bonus}, SHORT+{short_bonus}')\n\" 2>&1","timeout":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":114,"output":1344,"cacheRead":56704,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":58162,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1781007618941}}
