{"type":"message","id":"08043bd9","parentId":"fa0e1073","timestamp":"2026-06-09T12:20:45.036Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The logic is working correctly:\n\n- Extreme fear (current market): SHORT gets +15, LONG gets 0 → system will strongly favor shorts, no more catching falling knives\n- Extreme greed: LONG gets +15, SHORT gets 0 → system will follow bullish trend\n- Neutral/ranging: no bonus either way, purely technical indicators decide\n\nNow let me give the summary to the user. Let me also remember to note the restart requirement.\n\nChanged files:\n1. `crypto_signal_monitor.py` - 3 changes (sentiment_score reversed, global SENTIMENT_ENGINE, wired into calc_score)\n2. `SOUL.md` - scoring dimensions updated\n\nNeed to remind about kj restart.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"改完了。总结：\n\n---\n\n**改动的文件：**\n\n**1. `scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py`** — 三处改动\n- `sentiment_score` 逻辑反转：恐惧→做空+10~15，贪婪→做多+10~15，费率也是顺势\n- 新增模块级 `SENTIMENT_ENGINE` 全局变量\n- `calc_score` 接入情绪分，作为第⑤评分维度\n\n**2. `SOUL.md`** — 评分维度从旧版（RSI+MA60）更新为实际代码逻辑（价格突破+成交量+ATR+BTC趋势+情绪）\n\n---\n\n**情绪分流效果（验证通过）：**\n\n| 市场 | 情绪加分 | 效果 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| 极端恐惧 (fg=10) | LONG 0 / SHORT +15 | 不接飞刀，顺势做空 |\n| 极度贪婪 (fg=80) | LONG +15 / SHORT 0 | 顺势追涨 |\n| 震荡中性 (fg=50) | 0 / 0 | 纯技术指标决定 |\n\n改完需要 `kj` 重启才能生效。要我直接重启还是等你？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":151,"output":559,"cacheRead":57728,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":58438,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1781007635358}}
