{"type":"message","id":"c49a5edf","parentId":"e456311d","timestamp":"2026-06-09T13:02:14.509Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking if I've verified all the changes. Let me do a comprehensive final check:\n\n1. Syntax check - already passed ✅\n2. Logic check with scenarios - already passed ✅\n3. But I should also check that the SENTIMENT_ENGINE global is properly initialized before calc_score is called. Let me verify the order of operations in the main loop.\n\nLet me also check if there are edge cases:\n- What if fg is None or 0? That should be fine since the conditions use < and > comparisons.\n- What if funding_rate is 0? Fine, no bonus.\n- What if SENTIMENT_ENGINE is None? We check `if SENTIMENT_ENGINE:` so it's safe.\n\nLet me also do a quick import check to make sure the module loads correctly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_HDbZ3ioNwmUxbfUY6z2T1244","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\n# 完整加载校验\nimport importlib.util\nspec = importlib.util.spec_from_file_location('monitor', 'crypto_signal_monitor.py')\nmod = importlib.util.module_from_spec(spec)\n# 不实际执行主循环，只检查关键函数和变量定义\nspec.loader.exec_module(mod)\n\n# 1. SENTIMENT_ENGINE 初始值为 None\nprint('1. SENTIMENT_ENGINE 初始值:', mod.SENTIMENT_ENGINE)\n\n# 2. calc_score 存在且可调用\nassert callable(mod.calc_score), 'calc_score 不可调用'\n\n# 3. 测试 calc_score 在 SENTIMENT_ENGINE=None 时的表现（不应崩溃）\ntry:\n    score, dir = mod.calc_score(\n        'BTC', {'price': 62000}, {'vol_avg20': 100, 'vol_current': 50, \n         'atr_pct': 0.02, 'resistance': 63000, 'support': 61000},\n        'ranging', 10, 0, {'ema20_15m': 61000, 'ema60_15m': 62000}\n    )\n    print(f'2. 无情绪引擎时 calc_score 正常: score={score}, dir={dir}')\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f'2. ❌ calc_score 异常: {e}')\n\n# 4. SentimentEngine 实例化后\nse = mod.SentimentEngine()\nbonus_long = se.sentiment_score('BTC', 'LONG', 10, -0.003)\nbonus_short = se.sentiment_score('BTC', 'SHORT', 10, -0.003)\nprint(f'3. 极端恐惧: LONG+{bonus_long}, SHORT+{bonus_short}')\n\nbonus_long = se.sentiment_score('BTC', 'LONG', 80, 0.005)\nbonus_short = se.sentiment_score('BTC', 'SHORT', 80, 0.005)\nprint(f'4. 极度贪婪: LONG+{bonus_long}, SHORT+{bonus_short}')\n\nbonus_long = se.sentiment_score('BTC', 'LONG', 50, 0)\nbonus_short = se.sentiment_score('BTC', 'SHORT', 50, 0)\nprint(f'5. 中性市场: LONG+{bonus_long}, SHORT+{bonus_short}')\n\n# 5. 模拟赋值后 calc_score\nmod.SENTIMENT_ENGINE = se\nscore, dir = mod.calc_score(\n    'BTC', {'price': 62000}, {'vol_avg20': 100, 'vol_current': 50,\n     'atr_pct': 0.02, 'resistance': 63000, 'support': 61000},\n    'ranging', 10, -0.003, {'ema20_15m': 61000, 'ema60_15m': 62000}\n)\nprint(f'6. 接入情绪后(fg=10): score={score}, dir={dir}')\n\nprint('\\\\n✅ 全部校验通过')\n\" 2>&1","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":337,"output":1118,"cacheRead":58240,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":59695,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1781010118859}}
