{"type":"message","id":"a0a829d2","parentId":"01bb7cbb","timestamp":"2026-06-09T13:22:15.933Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent! Let me analyze the results:\n\n1. **BNB SHORT @597.15**: Score 60, AI says SHORT (75%), both agree → opened SHORT ✅\n2. **BTC SHORT @62527.3**: Score 60, AI says SHORT (70%), both agree → opened SHORT ✅\n\nBoth positions are SHORT with Fear & Greed at 10 (extreme fear). This is exactly what we wanted:\n- Before: in extreme fear, LONG would get +10 sentiment bonus, likely pushing LONG signals above threshold\n- Now: SHORT gets +10~15 sentiment bonus, pushing SHORT signals above threshold\n\nBoth AI and math agree on SHORT. The directions are correct - no falling knife catching.\n\nBoth are currently profitable: BNB +0.55, BTC +0.59.\n\nOnly 2 positions open (way below the 4 max), which means the signals are more selective now - no false LONG signals getting through.\n\nThis is working correctly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"方向对了 👑 两个都是空单，效果立竿见影：\n\n| 持仓 | 方向 | 评分 | AI | 盈亏 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| BNB | 🔴 空 | 60 | 做空 75% ✅ | +0.55 |\n| BTC | 🔴 空 | 60 | 做空 70% ✅ | +0.59 |\n\n三点改善很明显：\n\n1. **方向对了** — 极度恐惧市场，全是空单，没有之前那种逆势接多\n2. **AI 和数学一致** — 两边都说做空，没有打架\n3. **只开了 2 个** — 信号比之前挑剔了，不再因为情绪加分乱推伪信号过线\n\n目前两个都浮盈，情绪引擎终于没有拖后腿了。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1239,"output":604,"cacheRead":68096,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":69939,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1781011325678}}
