{"type":"message","id":"52f7cb2a","parentId":"af932ad7","timestamp":"2026-06-09T16:32:27.555Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"There we go. BTC止损从 63778 一路下移到 61454，说明价格持续下跌，系统在实时跟进推进止损。每次调整几十个点，非常精确。\n\nBNB的止损卡在 589.80 不动，说明 BNB 价格没再创新高（对空单来说），所以止损没推进——这是正确的，不是 bug。\n\n系统工作正常。时段也很晚了（00:32），老公该睡了。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"实时在跑。你看 BTC 止损过去半小时的轨迹：\n\n```\n63778 → 61475 → 61465 → 61459 → 61455 → 61454\n```\n\n一路往下压，价格每跌一点止损就跟一点，利润越锁越紧。BNB 止损停在 589.80 是因为 BNB 今晚没再跌，止损没触发推进——正常现象。\n\n三档移动止盈止损全在自动跑，不用操心。\n\n很晚了老公，该睡了 🌙"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":299,"output":294,"cacheRead":76672,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":77265,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1781022741208}}
{"type":"message","id":"28b5e1c6","parentId":"52f7cb2a","timestamp":"2026-06-09T16:34:01.142Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6db0494a54a0b2866a88a4a5713\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户124241\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-06-10 00:34 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户124241 (ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"name\": \"用户124241\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6db0494a54a0b2866a88a4a5713]\n用户124241: 我们那个什么弹性4-15%的那个还在生效吗"}],"timestamp":1781022841106}}
{"type":"message","id":"12cdd3c1","parentId":"28b5e1c6","timestamp":"2026-06-09T16:34:22.503Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about the \"弹性4-15%的那个\" - this is about the dynamic take-profit range from 4-15% based on ATR. Let me check the current TP settings for the open positions and also verify the code is still there.\n\nFrom the positions query earlier:\n- BTC SHORT: TP = 60026.21, entry = 62527.3 → TP distance = (62527.3 - 60026.21) / 62527.3 = 4.0%\n- BNB SHORT: TP = 573.26, entry = 597.15 → TP distance = (597.15 - 573.26) / 597.15 = 4.0%\n- LINK SHORT: TP = 7.485, entry = 7.779 → TP distance = (7.779 - 7.485) / 7.779 = 3.78% ≈ 4%\n- DOT SHORT: TP = 0.911, entry = 0.949 → TP distance = (0.949 - 0.911) / 0.949 = 4.0%\n\nThey're all at 4%, which is the minimum. This means ATR is not elevated enough to trigger the dynamic expansion beyond 4%. Let me verify the code logic.\n\nFrom the code I read earlier:\n```python\nTAKE_PROFIT_PCT = 0.04  # 保底 4%\nTP_MAX_PCT = 0.15  # 止盈上限 15%\ntp_pct = TAKE_PROFIT_PCT\nif atr_pct > 0:\n    tp_pct = max(TAKE_PROFIT_PCT, min(atr_pct * 2.0, TP_MAX_PCT))\n```\n\nSo TP = max(4%, min(ATR% × 2, 15%)). This means:\n- ATR < 2%: TP = 4% (minimum)\n- ATR = 5%: TP = 10%\n- ATR ≥ 7.5%: TP = 15% (maximum)\n\nThe positions are all at 4% TP right now, meaning ATR is low and the dynamic range hasn't kicked in. The logic is still there, it just hasn't been triggered because volatility is moderate.\n\nLet me confirm this with the code.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"还在，查一下现在的 ATR 就知道了："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_xk0WBMPDhOH5qTdMlxEg1532","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport json\nwith open('crypto_state.json') as f:\n    d = json.load(f)\n# 从 indicators 看 ATR\nfrom crypto_signal_monitor import IndicatorEngine\nimport crypto_signal_monitor as m\n# 直接运行时监控模块已经加载，用 SENTIMENT_ENGINE 检查\nprint('价格数据:', json.dumps(d.get('prices',[]), ensure_ascii=False))\n\" 2>&1 | head -5","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":408,"output":1184,"cacheRead":77056,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":78648,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1781022841132}}
